  {
   "id": "captain-puff-macfly-361728@major-2026-07-03",
   "gameId": "captain-puff-macfly-361728",
   "displayName": "Major Update: Death Coin items are now permanent",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-03T18:27:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Pilots, get ready for the Upgrade! 🛠️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The newest update for Captain Puff Macfly has just landed, and it is going to completely change how you plan your survival strategy. We've listened to your feedback and completely reworked the Death Coin item system to give your ship way more freedom and firepower!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is what changed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🛠️ Fixed Ship Items: Now, when you buy an item with your Death Coins, it becomes permanently equipped to your ship. This means that even if you fail and die, the item resets to its default number of uses on your next attempt. No more fear of losing that rare item!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔄 Free Replacement: Found a better item for your current playstyle? No problem! You can visit the shop and replace your items whenever you want to try out new strategies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔥 Combos: You can now equip and combine up to 2 items at the same time, creating devastating synergies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Why did we change this? 🤔",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We want you to fully enjoy your favorite items without the harsh punishment of losing them forever upon death. This change was designed so you can customize your ship for specific stages that require a unique strategy or a mandatory item, making the challenge fairer and a whole lot more fun in Captain Puff Macfly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Find the perfect combo, beat that stage that seemed impossible, and let us know what you think of the new mechanics in the comments!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy star hunting! 🌌",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
